    "title": "Is Costco open or closed on Easter? Here's what to know",
    "text": "April 5, 2026, 12:01 a.m. ETEaster is here and shoppers needing to make a last-minute trip to the grocery store are in luck, as many grocery store chains will remain open on the holiday.Some restaurant chains and retailers will also remain open on Sunday, April 5, while banks, post offices, and shipping services will be closed.Costco will not be an option for shoppers on Easter Sunday this year, as the company's website says warehouses will be closed in observation of the holiday.Here's what to know about other retail and grocery store chains and whether or not they'll be open on Easter in 2026.What grocery stores are open and closed on Easter?Here's which grocery stores are open on Easter. Hours are listed for the companies that provided them.WalmartMost stores in the Kroger family of companies will be open on Sunday (Baker’s, City Market, Dillons, Food 4 Less, Foods Co, Fred Meyer, Fry’s, Gerbes, Jay C Food Store, King Soopers, Kroger, Mariano’s, Metro Market, Pay-Less Super Markets, Pick’n Save, QFC, Ralphs, Ruler, Smith’s Food and Drug).BJ's Wholesale ClubTrader Joe'sFood LionWhole FoodsSafewayWegmansMeijer; 6 a.m. to midnightHarris TeeterA majority of Albertson's banner stores will be open on Easter (Safeway, Albertsons, Jewel-Osco, ACME, Vons and Tom Thumb).LidlGiant Eagle; Stores will close at 4 p.m.Winn-DixieHere's which grocery stores are closed on Easter. Hours are listed for the companies that provided them.CostcoSam's ClubTargetAldiPublixWhat retail stores are open and closed on Easter?Stores listed below will be open on April 5. Hours are listed for the companies that provided them.Home Depot; 8 a.m. to 6 p.m.Ace HardwareSephoraBarnes & NobleBass Pro Shop; 10 a.m. to 7 p.m.Cabela's; 10 a.m. to 7 p.m.REI; Noon to 6 p.m.IKEA; Stores will close at 6 p.m.PetcoPetSmart; 11 a.m. to 6 p.m.Tractor Supply Company; 9 a.m. to 6 p.m.Stores listed below will be closed on Easter.TargetTJ MaxxMarshall'sHomeGoodsLowe'sMacy'sKohl'sVictoria's SecretBelkOffice DepotOfficeMaxGabe Hauari is a national trending news reporter at USA TODAY. You can follow him on X @GabeHauari or email him at Gdhauari@gannett.com.",
